{
  "_comment": [
    "Area routing for issue triage. Rows with more than one login are rotated",
    "round-robin by `triage owner <scope>` so one person does not absorb a whole",
    "backlog sweep. Keys are scope label names exactly as they appear on GitHub.",
    "An empty list means no configured owner: fall back to deriving candidates",
    "from recent commits to the implicated path. Ownership moves; when a row goes",
    "stale, fix it here rather than working around it."
  ],
